<span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code></div>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;bitset&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/bitset\"><span class=\"kw1034\">std::<span class=\"me2\">bitset</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">8</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> b<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu6\">0b01110010</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> b <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" (initial value)<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> b.<span class=\"me1\">any</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> b <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">while</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy3\">!</span>b.<span class=\"me1\">test</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n            b <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> b <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> b <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" (final value)<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>01110010 (initial value)\n00111001\n00000111\n00000011\n00000001\n00000000 (final value)</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/rotl\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>rotl</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  computes the result of bitwise left-rotation <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/rotr\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>rotr</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  computes the result of bitwise right-rotation <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/bitset/operator_logic\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator&amp;=</span><span>operator|=</span><span>operator^=</span><span>operator~</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  performs binary AND, OR, XOR and NOT <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":